Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.70,0:00:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Шиндай Оуми
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.18,0:00:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.18,0:00:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Ей, сен жалқаусың.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.55,0:00:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.55,0:00:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,...
